# Production Backend API URL (e.g. Railway, Render, Fly.io, AWS)
# Leave empty for local development (uses Vite proxy to http://localhost:5000)
# In production on Vercel, add this in: Vercel Dashboard > Project Settings > Environment Variables
# Do NOT add a trailing slash.
# Example:
# VITE_API_URL=https://wanderlust-backend.up.railway.app
VITE_API_URL=
